Third-party notices
===================

Zerkalo can download the two datasets below for optional cyber geo-routing
annotations. They are not stored in git. `scripts/fetch_geo_dat.py` checks
each file against `data/geo.lock.json` and the official `.sha256sum` asset
from the same release, and refuses to install a file whose digest differs.
The forecast does not read these files while geo-routing is off.

The bytes are used unmodified.


